[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=11 format=3]

[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://assets/ui/fonts/kenney_future.ttf" id="1_font"]

; The warm/brass build-and-craft theme built on `scripts/ui/ui_tokens.gd`
; (`docs/decisions/D28`).
;
; Same structure as `tetherbound_theme.tres` — same sub-resource and Theme
; entry names — swapped to the token module's `BUILD_*` palette: brass
; (`BUILD_ACCENT`, `#D9C08A`) instead of teal, so a build/craft surface reads
; as a distinct place from the exploration HUD and pause menu rather than
; those screens borrowed wholesale. Focus here is a 2px brass border plus a
; brighter fill, the same "focus is the loudest state" rule the teal theme
; and the original `scenes/ui/menu_theme.tres` both already follow, just in
; this theme's own accent.
;
; Nothing in the live game points at this file yet (`D28`) — it exists and
; loads, for whichever build/craft screen a follow-on item wires it into.

